Notes and considerations
•	The BankingService is implemented in Infrastructure to avoid Application depending on Infrastructure; Application exposes interfaces and DTOs only.
•	Controllers use the application service interfaces and ICurrentUserAccessor to ensure authenticated CustomerId is used.
•	Endpoints return safe responses: 401 for unauthenticated, 404/NotFound for not-owned resources (do not reveal existence for other customers).
•	All queries use AsNoTracking() for read-only operations.
•	Transaction result sets are bounded by a maximum (100).
•	Sensitive identifiers: credit card numbers are masked in the seed data and returned as MaskedCardNumber in DTO; do not expose full numbers.
